# No constants.
#
# This file exists because a static template is a pair: the core appends both
# "constants.typoscript" and "setup.typoscript" to the included path, and a
# static include that ships only one half is a static include whose other half
# silently does not exist. The values a development instance has to correct are
# not here either - they are written into the "constants" field of the root
# "sys_template" record by the seed definition, because a record's own field
# wins over everything it includes, which is what "correct the defaults" means.
#
# See "Configuration/Seeds/Instance.yaml", record "site-template".
